                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f86eb255-503c-4b2e-8773-8aeadad94b13",
                                "sense_id": "387aed6a-346f-3aa7-81da-169f0ce62b5a",
                                "text": "За обедом Хаджи-Мурат ничего не ел, кроме плова, которого он взял себе на тарелку из того самого места, из которого взяла себе Марья Васильевна.",
                                "translation": "At dinner he hardly ate anything except some pilau, to which he helped himself from the very part of the dish from which Marya Vasilevna had helped herself.",
                                "english": "At dinner he hardly ate anything except some pilau, to which he helped himself from the very part of the dish from which Marya Vasilevna had helped herself."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
